  click U_PICK href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Views/Tabs/TasksTabView.swift#L2411" "attemptStartSession(_ task). Called from the session picker sheet and the idle confirmation sheet. If TimelineReflow.anchoredConflict finds an anchored item in the way it sets sessionStartConflict for the Start anyway alert instead; otherwise it calls startSession(task:userName:) with the profile name." _blank
  click U_NOTIF href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/NudgeNotificationService.swift#L368" "startSession(for: taskID, context:). Runs on the Start session notification action. Returns when taskID is nil, when a session is already active, or when the task no longer exists. userName is the profile name or an empty string." _blank
  click C_START href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L71" "startSession(task:userName:). minutes = task.estimatedMinutes, 60 when nil. sessionEnd = now + minutes. Full order of its calls is in the table under the picture." _blank
  click C_PUBLISH href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L462" "publishSessionState(isActive: true, currentTaskID: task.id, timerEndDate: sessionEnd). Writes the dictionary, then WidgetCenter.reloadTimelines(ofKind: NudgeTaskWidget) so the widget shows the timer at once." _blank
  click K_STATE href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/SessionCoordinator.swift#L485" "App Group group.com.deblaser.nudge, key activeSessionState. isActive true, isPaused false, timerEndDate (epoch seconds), currentTaskID (UUID string), startedAt (epoch seconds, read only by the app's restore)." _blank
  click L_START href "https://github.com/deblaseroman/nudge-app/blob/ede6774/Nudge/Services/LiveActivityManager.swift#L21" "startActivity(userName:taskTitle:taskEnds:). Returns without doing anything when ActivityAuthorizationInfo().areActivitiesEnabled is false. Attributes: userName, totalTasksToday 1, currentTaskIndex 1. State: taskName, .active, timerEnd = taskEnds, nextTaskName nil. A thrown error is caught and printed by startSession." _blank
  click AK_REQ href "https://developer.apple.com/documentation/activitykit/activity" "Activity.request(attributes:content:pushType: nil). content.staleDate = taskEnds, so the system marks the activity stale at the session's end instant even if the app is not running." _blank
